§§ `s 34 to s 36`

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
      e IS A NUMBER
      f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Facts for a solvency test in Part V`
`solvency facts` a b c d e f MEANS
    `Facts for a solvency test in Part V` WITH
        `reasonable grounds exist for believing that the corporation is, or would after the step be, unable to pay its liabilities as they become due` IS a
        `realizable value of the corporation's assets after the step, in dollars` IS b
        `liabilities of the corporation, in dollars` IS c
        `stated capital of all classes, in dollars` IS d
        `amount required, on a redemption or in a liquidation, to pay the holders of shares that must be paid before the shares to be acquired and not included in the liabilities, in dollars` IS e
        `amount required, on a redemption or in a liquidation, to pay the holders of shares that must be paid rateably with or before the shares to be acquired and not included in the liabilities, in dollars` IS f
        `the corporation is an open-end mutual fund` IS FALSE

-- src:572-574: assets 1,000 after the payment against liabilities 600 plus stated capital 400: equal is not less
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares within s 34(2)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 1000 600 400 0 0))
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares within s 34(2)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 999 600 400 0 0)
-- reasonable grounds for believing the corporation unable to pay its liabilities as they become due, whatever the assets
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares within s 34(2)` (`solvency facts` TRUE 5000 600 400 0 0)
-- an open-end mutual fund: the stated capital provisions do not apply (s 26(11)), so its stated capital term is nil (fork cb1-F9)
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Facts for a solvency test in Part V`
`fund facts` a b c d MEANS
    `Facts for a solvency test in Part V` WITH
        `reasonable grounds exist for believing that the corporation is, or would after the step be, unable to pay its liabilities as they become due` IS a
        `realizable value of the corporation's assets after the step, in dollars` IS b
        `liabilities of the corporation, in dollars` IS c
        `stated capital of all classes, in dollars` IS d
        `amount required, on a redemption or in a liquidation, to pay the holders of shares that must be paid before the shares to be acquired and not included in the liabilities, in dollars` IS 0
        `amount required, on a redemption or in a liquidation, to pay the holders of shares that must be paid rateably with or before the shares to be acquired and not included in the liabilities, in dollars` IS 0
        `the corporation is an open-end mutual fund` IS TRUE

#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares within s 34(2)` (`fund facts` FALSE 600 600 400))
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares within s 34(2)` (`fund facts` FALSE 599 600 400)
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares within s 34(2)` (`fund facts` TRUE 5000 600 400)
-- src:570
#ASSERT `the corporation may purchase or otherwise acquire shares issued by it within s 34(1)` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or otherwise acquire shares issued by it within s 34(1)` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or otherwise acquire shares issued by it within s 34(1)` FALSE TRUE)
-- src:576-583: purposes (1)(a) to (c) are subject to the articles and (3); (2)(a) and (b) are subject to neither
#ASSERT `the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to settle or compromise a debt or claim asserted by or against the corporation` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to settle or compromise a debt or claim asserted by or against the corporation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to settle or compromise a debt or claim asserted by or against the corporation` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to eliminate fractional shares` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to eliminate fractional shares` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to fulfil the terms of a non-assignable agreement under which the corporation has an option or is obliged to purchase shares owned by a director, an officer or an employee of the corporation` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to fulfil the terms of a non-assignable agreement under which the corporation has an option or is obliged to purchase shares owned by a director, an officer or an employee of the corporation` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to satisfy the claim of a shareholder who dissents under section 190` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `to comply with an order under section 241` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or acquire shares issued by it for the purpose within s 35(1) and s 35(2)` `any other purpose` FALSE FALSE)
-- src:585-589: assets against liabilities plus the amount owed to holders to be paid first, and NOT stated capital
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares under s 35(1) within s 35(3)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 800 500 400 300 0))
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares under s 35(1) within s 35(3)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 799 500 400 300 0)
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares under s 35(1) within s 35(3)` (`solvency facts` TRUE 5000 500 400 300 0)
-- the same figures that s 34(2) would forbid (assets 600, liabilities 500, stated capital 400) do not fall foul of s 35(3), which has no stated capital limb
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares under s 35(1) within s 35(3)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 600 500 400 0 0))
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to acquire its shares within s 34(2)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 600 500 400 0 0)
-- src:591: redeemable shares, at a price not exceeding the redemption price, subject to (2) and the articles
#ASSERT `the corporation may purchase or redeem the shares at the price within s 36(1)` TRUE 10 10 FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the corporation may purchase or redeem the shares at the price within s 36(1)` TRUE 9 10 FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or redeem the shares at the price within s 36(1)` TRUE 11 10 FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or redeem the shares at the price within s 36(1)` FALSE 10 10 FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or redeem the shares at the price within s 36(1)` TRUE 10 10 TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may purchase or redeem the shares at the price within s 36(1)` TRUE 10 10 FALSE TRUE)
-- src:593-597: assets against liabilities plus the amount owed to those paid rateably with or before
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to purchase or redeem redeemable shares within s 36(2)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 700 500 400 0 200))
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to purchase or redeem redeemable shares within s 36(2)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 699 500 400 0 200)
#ASSERT `the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to purchase or redeem redeemable shares within s 36(2)` (`solvency facts` TRUE 5000 500 400 0 200)
-- the "before" figure of s 35(3) is not the "rateably with or before" figure of s 36(2)
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is forbidden to make the payment to purchase or redeem redeemable shares within s 36(2)` (`solvency facts` FALSE 700 500 400 300 200))

